    "Off" : {

    },
    "Off drafts reads only: a draft that is not a plain SELECT is refused instead of offered. Pharos never runs a draft either way." : {

    },
    "Off lists them along a bar above the results grid instead." : {

    },
    "Off makes every result read-only. An edit is never written until you review and apply it, whichever this says." : {

    },
    "Off writes one tab character instead. Shift-Tab takes back one level either way." : {

    },
    "Off, “Suggest chart” still applies the chart Pharos recommends for these columns." : {

    },
    "Offer to format a pasted list" : {

    },
    "OK" : {

    },
    "Older entries and their cached results are removed as new queries are recorded. Forever keeps everything." : {

    },
    "On double-click" : {

    },
    "On launch only" : {

    },
    "On, the password is written to your login keychain and this connection opens without asking. Off, Pharos asks you for it the first time you connect after each launch, keeps it in memory only, and DELETES the one already in your keychain when you save." : {

    },
    "On, the SSH password or key passphrase is written to your login keychain and the tunnel opens without asking. Off, Pharos asks you for it the first time the tunnel is refused after each launch, keeps it in memory only, and DELETES the one already in your keychain when you save. This is separate from the database password's own switch." : {

    },
    "One ASCII character, used when the delimiter above is Custom. Anything else falls back to a comma." : {

